DU(1)                       User Commands

NAME
    du - estimate disk usage

SYNOPSIS
    du [-s] [file...]

DESCRIPTION
    du prints the size in KiB of each directory below the named files,
    and of each file named directly, rounding every file up to whole KiB.
    -s prints only the total of each operand. Without operands du starts
    at the current directory. A symbolic link counts with the length of
    its target and is never followed, so a link to a directory is not
    entered.

SEE ALSO
    df(1), find(1)
